option.AUTO_EXPOSURE=Auto Exposure
option.AUTO_EXPOSURE.comment=Enable metering to set exposure automatically. Turn it off to set exposure manually.
option.CAMERA_METERING_MODE=Metering Mode
option.CAMERA_METERING_MODE.comment=Center-weighted metering reads the whole frame with extra weight at the center. Center spot and spot meter approximately 25% and 2.5% of the frame around the crosshair. Smart metering evaluates 16 zones independently and leaves exposure headroom for broad highlights. Applies to auto exposure.
value.CAMERA_METERING_MODE.0=Center-weighted
value.CAMERA_METERING_MODE.1=Spot
value.CAMERA_METERING_MODE.2=Center Spot
value.CAMERA_METERING_MODE.3=Smart (Multi-zone)
option.CAMERA_VIEWFINDER=Viewfinder Aids
option.CAMERA_VIEWFINDER.comment=Show the whole-frame preview luminance histogram and the metering area for Center Spot or Spot.
option.EXPOSURE=Exposure (EV)
option.EXPOSURE.comment=Exposure compensation is subject to the auto exposure limits. In manual mode, each +1 EV doubles the exposure multiplier.
option.CAMERA_MIN_EV=Auto Exposure Minimum (EV)
option.CAMERA_MAX_EV=Auto Exposure Maximum (EV)
option.CAMERA_MIN_EV.comment=Lowest allowed exposure in bright scenes. -1 EV halves the baseline exposure.
option.CAMERA_MAX_EV.comment=Highest allowed exposure in dark scenes. +1 EV doubles the baseline exposure.
option.CAMERA_ADAPT_BRIGHT=Bright Adaptation (s)
option.CAMERA_ADAPT_DARK=Dark Adaptation (s)
option.CAMERA_ADAPT_BRIGHT.comment=Time constant for lowering exposure. A smaller value adapts faster when entering bright light.
option.CAMERA_ADAPT_DARK.comment=Time constant for raising exposure. A smaller value adapts faster when entering darkness.
option.CAMERA_AUTO_WHITE_BALANCE=Auto White Balance
option.CAMERA_AUTO_WHITE_BALANCE.comment=Estimate the illuminant from near-neutral materials and adapt smoothly. Turn off to adjust temperature and tint manually.
option.CAMERA_COLOR_TEMPERATURE=Manual Temperature (K)
option.CAMERA_COLOR_TEMPERATURE.comment=Applies when Auto White Balance is off. Lower values cool the image and higher values warm it. Defaults to 6500 K.
option.CAMERA_COLOR_TINT=Manual Tint
option.CAMERA_COLOR_TINT.comment=Applies when Auto White Balance is off. Negative values shift toward green and positive values toward magenta. Defaults to 0.
